  "prior_art": "Pinned BOMPAC-4861 co-assigns all six; Grajewski2022 excludes8201/8304 as one book despite same hand. E44-E46 already find8066/9620 five-rule compatibility and probable different related chant items. This audit does not create new candidate pairs or rediscover those observations.",
  "prior_exposure": "Unblinded: existing descriptions and8066/9620/8201/8304 readings known.8072/8073 have only retained first thumbnails before this audit; no untouched recognition evaluation or independent adjudication.",
  "predictions": [
    "Review the full available target views and record literal rubric/chant boundaries, original-looking addresses and visible writing-field/staff construction before interpreting them. Distinguish staff rules from text baselines/photographic rulers and musical custodes from quire/catchwords.",
    "Test whether a specific complete corresponding chant/text sequence or secure physical/address feature distinguishes a candidate pair. Different feasts, genre labels, generic words and absent cropped text cannot exclude one book.",
    "Compare any proposed shared copying-layout feature with the known wrong8201/8304 pair. If that control also shares it, record the failure to discriminate; do not promote shared appearance or catalogue measurements to book identity.",
    "Within-object changes, reused folds, cropping, different sections/hands and composite volumes are alternatives to a book exclusion. A page-template difference challenges an unchanged uniform layout only, unless stronger corresponding evidence excludes those alternatives.",
    "Publish a per-pair evidence/result matrix for all13 existing pending group edges, including negative/inconclusive outcomes. A completed limited primary comparison can clear its first-comparison flag but cannot silently complete historical adjudication or resolve a decision state.",
    "Do not rerun generic matching, optimize recognition thresholds, claim a unique codex or count repeated source views as independent corroboration. If no discriminating result emerges, record concrete missing inputs rather than continuing the same feature screen."
